{"id": "q0104", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2916162406, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Let $n$ be a positive integer.  What is the greatest possible value of $\\gcd(n + 7, 2n + 1)$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0104.wav", "input_sha256": "c27f56e90b9422f9d1e855d81785113269e96879ee57f4e1d7705a9c61a2fa04", "input_samples": 130600, "input_s": 8.162, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.955, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The greatest possible value is 13. Since \\[ \\gcd(n+7,\\,2n+1) \\] must divide any integer linear combination of \\(n+7\\) and \\(2n+1\\), it divides \\[ 2(n+7)-(2n+1)=13. \\] So the gcd can be at most \\(13\\). This maximum is achievable: take \\(n=6\\). Then \\[ n+7=13,\\qquad 2n+1=13, \\] so \\[ \\gcd(13,13)=13. \\] \\[ \\boxed{13} \\]", "expert_answer": "The greatest possible value is **13**.\n\nSince  \n\\[\n\\gcd(n+7,\\,2n+1)\n\\]\nmust divide any integer linear combination of \\(n+7\\) and \\(2n+1\\), it divides\n\n\\[\n2(n+7)-(2n+1)=13.\n\\]\n\nSo the gcd can be at most \\(13\\). This maximum is achievable: take \\(n=6\\). Then\n\n\\[\nn+7=13,\\qquad 2n+1=13,\n\\]\n\nso\n\n\\[\n\\gcd(13,13)=13.\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{13}\n\\]", "transcript": "Let n dollars be a positive integer. What is the greatest possible value of gcd n plus 7, 2n plus 1? Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 4.03, "expert_s": 4.67, "expert_input_samples": 130600, "expert_input_s": 8.162, "expert_input_sha256": "c27f56e90b9422f9d1e855d81785113269e96879ee57f4e1d7705a9c61a2fa04", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.0, "relay_synth_ms": 54520, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 2721, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 11890, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_balanced_relay.wav", "sha256": "7a8ca1fc4e9e04692d5827c0e0db8aabf61df24c9efaf00a4c6ba9a35318a338", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 143.88}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_balanced_candidate.wav", "sha256": "4300b4a12b2fd684cca2d892e9f0e26e0ea4b8d7827268e70336f95c6754df37", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_balanced_stall.wav", "sha256": "c133959136145966d5653b0a5884f0b789d38c2651307143ad73b1a5193853bb", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 61.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.053, 1.095, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.054, 2.096, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.055, 3.097, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.055, 4.099, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.056, 5.1, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.055, 6.099, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.054, 7.098, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.056, 8.1, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 8.162, 8.217, 8.769, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.162, 11.94, 12.585, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.162, 12.641, 13.286, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.162, 13.341, 13.873, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.162, 13.931, 14.432, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.162, 14.488, 15.105, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.162, 15.161, 15.729, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.162, 15.786, 16.298, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.163, 16.354, 16.861, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.163, 17.22, 17.945, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.163, 18.221, 18.751, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.163, 19.22, 19.819, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.163, 20.221, 20.75, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.163, 21.221, 21.752, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.163, 22.22, 22.824, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.163, 23.222, 23.799, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.163, 24.221, 24.799, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.163, 25.222, 25.754, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.163, 26.221, 26.772, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.163, 27.225, 27.817, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.163, 28.223, 28.776, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.163, 29.22,