{"id": "q0493", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3837589351, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "设计国际妇女节活动海报。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0493.wav", "input_sha256": "5cab842fcf0eccba7017b655bcbfa43388c0f3eaccf81625ccbb3ea496bce742", "input_samples": 40600, "input_s": 2.538, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.5608, "act": 0.9918, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，没问题。为了设计一个国际妇女节活动的海报，我首先会确定主题和目标观众。比如是面向公众、学生还是企业？然后我会选择一些能体现女性力量和团结的图片，比如女性聚在一起笑容灿烂或者在工作中的场景。颜色上可以用粉色、紫色和白色搭配，显得既温馨又充满活力。标题要简洁有力，像“庆祝女性成就”或者“共建更美好未来”。还要包括活动时间、地点和主要内容，比如演讲、工作坊或展览。最后加上一句鼓励性的口号，吸引大家来参加。你觉得这样行吗？", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 45, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0493_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "aee6da8cdbeb3dc0fcaffbfe099b79b2f56a54942ec15ed6911b8c6e5cd618d9", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 45.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.056, 1.098, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.054, 2.096, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.538, 2.591, 2.634, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.592, 4.005, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.593, 5.028, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 5.595, 6.086, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 6.595, 7.147, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 7.595, 8.123, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 8.595, 9.128, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 9.596, 10.101, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 10.593, 11.073, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.537, 11.595, 12.118, 0, 2